{"title": "Music Instrument Subtable", "pageid": 25763, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Music_Instrument_Subtable", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Subtables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Music Instrument Subtable</b>, also known as <code>ST_MusicInstrument</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ST_MusicInstrument+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ST_MusicInstrument+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a non-leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> consisting of musical instruments.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_table\">Drop table</span></h2>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Music Instrument Subtable}}</code>.</i> <i>Consists of one roll each on the <a href=\"/wiki/Common_Music_Instrument_Subtable\" title=\"Common Music Instrument Subtable\">Common Music Instrument Subtable</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Rare_Music_Instrument_Subtable\" title=\"Rare Music Instrument Subtable\">Rare Music Instrument Subtable</a>.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flute\" title=\"Flute\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/07/Instrument_Flute_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Instrument_Flute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/07/Instrument_Flute_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Instrument_Flute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/07/Instrument_Flute_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/07/Instrument_Flute_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Instrument_Flute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/07/Instrument_Flute_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Flute\" title=\"Flute\">Flute</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1/3</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hand_Drum\" title=\"Hand Drum\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Instrument_Hand_Drum_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Instrument_Hand_Drum_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Instrument_Hand_Drum_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Instrument_Hand_Drum_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/cf/Instrument_Hand_Drum_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Instrument_Hand_Drum_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Instrument_Hand_Drum_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Instrument_Hand_Drum_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hand_Drum\" title=\"Hand Drum\">Hand Drum</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1/3</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icont